(text "House rule: MHz crystals are bought with CL = 8 pF so every MHz block uses the same 12 pF C0G cap (24.576 / 48 MHz: CL 10 pF -> 15 pF);\n32.768 kHz uses CL 7 pF -> 10 pF (same 10 pF C0G as the buck feed-forward caps). Change Cs if your layout stray differs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215.90 158.70 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "066c3345-755a-407b-b867-67b1e93787b5"))
